Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I always sat in the back seat growing\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listening to my family laugh and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching my older siblings take the\Nwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came the day I sat in the driver's\Nseat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands gripped the wheel so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Checking the mirror over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, late at night, my phone lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone calls me when they need a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The quiet kid from the back seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the one who brings everyone home.
